Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our motto is provide a human touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you know we've been in\Nthe temp business 15 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and yes more than once\Nbankruptcy reared its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I used every dirty trick in the\Nbook to get us back on our feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On this fine day I finally get to taste the\Nfruits of all the blood sweat and tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe, Mr. President. No poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon Appetit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Tom Otsu and not Sumi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you pump out a\Nbunch of healthy boys for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brendan, you useless priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you've got to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you I didn't poison him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how'd you pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.55,0:01:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have been easy slipping\Npoison past a hotshot taster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The taster ate a lethal dose as\Nwell, he just wasn't aware of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.91,0:01:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.05,0:01:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spent the past three months adding\Nminuscule amounts to his food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until eventually, he built\Nup an immunity to the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:02:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense, but that sounds\Nabsurdly time-consuming. Well, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so absurd no one would think\Nwe'd be crazy enough to try it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of the game is stay\None step ahead of everyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Hikaru, have you given any\Nthought to the thing we talked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You getting married
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akari, do you seriously\Nthink I'm cut out for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.31,0:02:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I meet any women at work
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma says there's got to be\Na new head of the Poison Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either you or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I tried to tell her\NI'm out because I'm single,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she matched me up with a total\Nstranger from a branch family?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.29,0:02:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and nearly forced me to get hitched.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if I'm that desperate to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Poison Master's line will end with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.03,0:02:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm spending my life single.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you should spend yours\Nwith your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not like I can see\Ngirls going for you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:02:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk.
