Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bugmaster, been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.11,0:03:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Julia, cut that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word is the needle\Nmaster has three kids now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of them boys food\Nbill must be a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me I'm planning on staying a bachelor the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rest of my life easiest\Nway to keep my sanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah about that I haven't told you yet\Nbut I'm getting hitched pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.39,0:03:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a nice, quiet girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she accepts me for who I\Nam. Bugs and all. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caught you off guard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I figured you'd\Nhave more trouble than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you wouldn't know the pain,\Nbut I nearly died landing her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.83,0:03:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, look at you turning traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, marriage won't change the\Nfact that you and I are still best buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.99,0:04:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you, ghetto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.63,0:04:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this again when things settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Bug Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Respect, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding someone you care\Nabout and who cares about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.97,0:04:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll ever\Nbe able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I've ever had\Na high opinion of marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after hearing you talk about it tonight\Nit's crazy but I found myself thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.35,0:04:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that that sounds all right as\Nif it's ever going to happen for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me though it's such
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an honor to have you here man it looks like\Nthe business has been doing pretty well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back, thanks to guys like you, we offer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.45,0:04:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cleaning services and\Nwe'll get our hands dirty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for prices so affordable even your average
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe can swing them. Oh,\Nthe ladies work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're kind of assassin secretaries very\Nversatile so feel free to use it for work
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pleasure or however you like no thanks no
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ladies don't do it for you oh master
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ghetto watch out for i see you're admiring\Nour bulletproof glass partition up close
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meet the latest piece of human scum i'd\Nlike your help with i present the heartless
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,marriage swindler, Mei Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.89,0:05:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girls caused all sorts of trouble\Non our turf, but her meddling's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coming to an end right here and right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what's in store for
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poison will paralyze\Nnerves in your extremities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, it'll travel towards your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brain and make you feel like\Nyou're being ripped to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:06:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to be fully\Nconscious while it's happening
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, I will conclude with\Nthis coup de grace I concocted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your last thought will be\Nregretting you were born?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's back up i'm mei kinosaki and your\Nname is what have we met before? shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.05,0:06:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i i'm sorry but i i asked because
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you remind me of my first love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but alas so now the marriage swindler\Nis flirting with me to save herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.61,0:06:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotten several people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the only reason I did it is\Nbecause I desperately needed the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.51,0:06:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little brother's sick\Nand needs treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took all the loans I could get and\Nwork jobs I'd never confess to anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I still couldn't make enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I get the chance\Nto leave this world while
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the spinning image of\Nthe man I adored watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was wrong and\Nmy life isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before I pass away, at\Nleast tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely sure\Nabout this Gero guy, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only works on criminal targets\Nhe deems to be human scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of game is he playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.69,0:07:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is a legit poison master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Geros are one of the oldest\Nfamilies in the assassination biz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might have his fair\Nshare of stupid hang-ups,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's the real deal and\Ncomes highly recommended.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me sit back and watch him work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget I said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way this woman's acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the hots for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to call you\Non the emergency line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's wrong nothing\Ni'm moving back to the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:07:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,main house i wanted to\Ntell you before i go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why there'll be an heir\Nto the family when i
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.99,0:08:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give birth to a new\Npoison master one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,branch members needs a partner too are you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really going to do this\Nwithout talking to me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first you don't get it\Ndo you grandma is serious
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told me so herself. If you don't\Ncarry on the line and I refuse to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,volunteer they'll take away my freedom\Nand i'll be forced to have children
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if that's the alternative\Ni'd rather go on my own terms
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.85,0:08:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,akari Then what are you going\Nto do about your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to break up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or else what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.21,0:08:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to sacrifice\Nyourself in my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be even worse
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the only thing I'm good for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you agree to marry me, I\Npromise to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The short version is I need to find a partner\Nto become the head of the Poison Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I have to be with someone, might\Nas well be with the girl who likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can help with your\Nbrother's illness, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.93,0:09:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it almost feels unfair\Nhaving all of this luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My answer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.65,0:09:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a chance in\Nhell I would marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see that face\Nbefore I died, guess I am lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.49,0:09:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is how I died, it'd piss me off\Ngoing without getting one last shot in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for the void, Hubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever you see a couple, whether\Nit's their personalities, how much
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,money they make looks whatever the\Nreason they're together is because
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they make a good match but a piece\Nof shit who proposes to a target
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he can just kill if they say no not\Na good match for anyone suppose not
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know i think that\Nyou're gonna have to come
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clean with yourself first\Nthat's all you can do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're serious about\Nfinding someone people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find their ideal partner\Nby figuring each other
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out butting heads and\Nrunning themselves ragged
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that the future you're\Nafter or do you want
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married for the\Ninheritance ahem uh master
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,garrow do you think we\Ncould speed this along
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we are paying good money to watch\Nyou do your thing i only dispose of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the human scum that actually deserves\Nto die nothing to do with justice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't take jobs that'd make\Nit hard to sleep at night. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,murder is still murder right but\Nsometimes i'll catch myself wanting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to live a peaceful life with someone\Ni love and who loves me in return
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that side of me makes me sick to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my stomach you want the truth i want
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to meet someone i genuinely like\Nand lead a fun carefree life as much
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as the next guy a relationship where\Nshe asks how was your day and we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chat before falling asleep where\Nshe asks are you feeling all right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whenever i cough true love but there's\Nno way i'll ever meet someone like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that i never went to school not\Neven daycare i've lived as a poison
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,master since i was old enough to form\Nmemories showing any sign of weakness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.83,0:11:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,immediately leads to failure i've\Nnever allowed myself to open up to a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stranger like this, I've never bared\Nmy heart—not until now—which means
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you talking about you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poured your heart out to me and i only
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.87,0:11:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just met you listen you're right\Nbeing an assassin is a huge drawback
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but i think the solution\Nis just meeting more
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people when you're not\Non the clock if you put
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself out there and\Nallow your heart to get
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,broken a time or two I\Nguarantee that sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll find your perfect match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, it'll probably be hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:12:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I have for\Nyou, so let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only got myself to\Nblame for screwing up so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I wouldn't be here and my\Nbrother's medical bills would be paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.59,0:12:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've ruined the future of the\None person I truly care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the definition of scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Ghetto, why don't we call it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've heard all the dating\Nadvice our prisoners got to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop delaying and\Nfinish this scumbag off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.09,0:12:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I require her talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only an expert matchmaker could\Nhave married all those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have what it takes\Nto find me a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to protect you from\Nharm, both you and your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.81,0:12:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In exchange for my help, you'll\Nfind me someone to marry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.43,0:12:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I've been in so many\Nrelationships that I've lost count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've never gotten\Na proposal like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.53,0:12:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can accept it if\Nyou make it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:13:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, I'm disappointed, Master Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we have a deal then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, killing the Poison\NMaster's heir apparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna rocket to the top of\Nthe industry after we take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You offer your services to\Ncivilians at rock-bottom rates,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then blackmail them the rest\Nof their lives for hiring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many lives have you ruined?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I care? Get real!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with conning a few idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.77,0:13:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you're some kind\Nof hero or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was making sure you meet my condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all human scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's tease his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd he go? Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get a front row seat after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.09,0:14:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, watch the Poison Master work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.65,0:14:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're not just all talk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking out a room full of\Nprofessionals like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero times anything is still zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.69,0:14:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only used my 300 torments of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll live, but the trauma will\Nkeep them out of the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru, what I said earlier, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry\Nabout succeeding, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I said, I don't\Nhave any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:14:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're lucky enough to meet someone\Nyou can love and build a life with,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the closest thing\Nto a miracle there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is stay\Nwith your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass a message on to Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell her that I'm getting married\Nand leading the Poison Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one gets to decide who\Nmy partner is except me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, so are you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always decide everything on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and let her know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.77,0:15:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you soon. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need a hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how do I carry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never had to pick up a living girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where should I grab you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you'll have to worry\Nabout that, because I'm not a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.03,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs22\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,276)}The Poison Master's{\alpha&HFF&\t(128,129,\alpha&H00&)} Search for a Bride
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:16:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a bloodbath, a\Nshower hits different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it, Gero?\NCare to join? No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know about you, but\NI feel like a new man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you're thinking I don't\Nlook like any man you've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to confirm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you dress in women's clothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because my latest mark was a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I needed to dupe a\Nwoman, I'd dress as a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, it's more fun playing both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the best move\Nyou could have made.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proposing to me, I mean. Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can teach you to make anyone\Nfall for you, regardless of gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I registered you\Nfor a matchmaking party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Complete your profile and boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's after midnight,\Nwhich means the event's today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Profession? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Writing the truth is probably a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.81,0:16:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, self-employed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gonna be way more\Nmen there than women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll captivate the gents with my charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.09,0:17:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way, there'll be\Nfewer rivals for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, grooming and\Nfashion only goes so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All they do is make a\Ngood first impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leveling them up might get you the\Nnice guy status, but we want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's going to fall for you unless\Nwe find your charm and let it shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try different approaches\Nand see what sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there, it's very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My research indicates first\Nimpressions are everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I've developed the perfect pickup line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.27,0:17:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make million a year.\NMy charm is my income.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't it says right\Nhere money's desirable?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe so, but\Nblabbing about it right out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the gate makes it sound\Nlike you're bragging!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This next girl gaze into her eyes and\Nsmile before you open your dumb mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll research how normal\Npeople smile when I get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.89,0:18:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kero, looky here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dating app will give you a chance to\Nget your bearings when talking to girls.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.37,0:18:13.42,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fay0.05\fax-0.02\shad0\blur0.3\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\frx6\fry2\pos(430,260)}Send a message
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.38,0:18:13.42,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\fay0.05\fax-0.02\shad0\blur0.3\fs32\c&HC563F0&\frx6\fry2\pos(464,118.86)}Match!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.42,0:18:13.54,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\fay0.05\fax-0.02\shad0\blur0.3\fs32\c&HC563F0&\frx6\fry2\pos(469.57,122.29)}Match!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.42,0:18:13.54,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fay0.08\fax-0.02\shad0\blur0.3\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\frx6\fry2\pos(437,263.16)}Send a message
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.54,0:18:13.66,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\fay0.01\fax-0.02\shad0\blur0.3\fs32\c&HC563F0&\frx6\fry2\frz352.9\pos(482.86,131.43)}Match!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.54,0:18:13.66,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fay0.03\fax-0.02\shad0\blur0.3\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\frx6\fry2\frz352.9\pos(440.29,269)}Send a message
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.66,0:18:17.04,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0\fay0.05\fax-0.02\shad0\blur0.3\fs32\c&HC563F0&\frx6\fry2\frz352.9\pos(486,135.42)}Match!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.66,0:18:17.04,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fay0.05\fax-0.02\shad0\blur0.3\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&\frx6\fry2\frz352.9\pos(443.43,273)}Send a message
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And good news, I got\Nyou matched right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have a ton of chances with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.15,0:18:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.87,0:18:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A poison master should never eat\Nanything someone else serves him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I doubt anyone's after\Nmy life this second, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. I'm sure it will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.71,0:18:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See I'm doing totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay on to the next girl and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the next one and the next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over the course of today,\NI've met nearly 30 women.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and somehow I didn't exchange\Ncontact info with even one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did your best, so don't go\Nbeating yourself up over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.37,0:19:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our goal is to find your charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But while we're working hard\Nto figure out what that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would have been kind of nice if at\Nleast one date had gone moderately okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki, have you entertained the\Nidea of maybe I don't have any charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just hidden, so we\Ncan't see what it is yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise we'll find\Nsomeone who's into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems bleak, but I promise after\NI'm finished polishing you up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some lucky lady is going to\Nrealize that you're the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.31,0:19:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after watching you, I found\None thing we can work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.61,0:19:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DIY candy kits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People with niche hobbies can have\Na great time chatting about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.45,0:19:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, is it just me or is\Nthis cleaner wicked strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:19:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a mixture I came\Nup with called Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using deadly poison to combat stubborn\Nstains is my favorite way to de-stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make cleaning agents strong enough\Nto melt iron when I set my mind to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, does this count as\Nanother niche hobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just keep that a secret between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess this is goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.95,0:20:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.41,0:20:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.69,0:20:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're putting me\Nthrough more torture tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So soon?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.51,0:20:40.95,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fs9\fscx90\fax-0.05\c&H655D63&\pos(376,79)\frz334.7}Add Friend
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.13,0:20:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to tell me what you\Ndid to my big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spare me the dumb blonde act.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.05,0:20:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he was going to shake\Nup this lame-ass industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never could shut up about his big plans,\Nmaking those old farts beg for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:21:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he wants to take over our\Nparents' dry-cleaning service.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he just got tired\Nof life in the big city?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.81,0:21:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are white pellets, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.09,0:21:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of look\Nthat gets my blood pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.67,0:21:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to tell me\Neverything that went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you beg for your life\Nlike you mean it, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might give you a no - I'd rather die\Nthan team up with trash that con civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're human scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some guts, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take advantage of\Nfolks the same way we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate criminals with half-assed morality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't see a crime as a\Ncrime regardless of the target,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not cut out for\Nthis line of work, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pretty face is the\Nbest weapon you've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.07,0:21:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna make sure\Nyou never use it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.91,0:21:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This next shot will be a shotgun blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.27,0:21:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.57,0:21:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see him! Floor it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.41,0:22:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.25,0:22:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking over the dry cleaning\Nbiz doesn't sound so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.05,0:22:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.77,0:22:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you, Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.25,0:23:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could\Nhave met so many women
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.21,0:23:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in one day without your\Nguidance and support.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.19,0:23:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single rejection would have left me\Nbroken up and moping for a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.49,0:23:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.07,0:23:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.21,0:23:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get anyone's info either.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.09,0:23:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both struck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.41,0:23:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how would you feel\Nabout trading yours with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.52,0:23:22.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord2.5\shad0\blur0.3\b1\fs26\c&H393734&\3c&HF8F8F8&}Friends: 1
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt my friends list\Nwill get any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.87,0:23:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're dazzling me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.99,0:23:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.23,0:23:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I discovered your charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.67,0:23:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of the elite assassin,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Master Gero Hikaru,\Nand his search for a bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, you're going on your first dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.05,0:23:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For her, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.11,0:23:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will you say to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.27,0:23:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the intent to marry?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.45,0:23:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.22,0:23:56.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs22\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,276)}What Is "Charm," Anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.45,0:23:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, what is charm anyway?

